; The functions of the NPU driver's xrt_coreutil.dll that the XRT shim (vendor/xrt-shim)
; calls, by name. The backend binds them when it starts.
; XRT ships no import library on Windows; CMake builds one from this file.
; Taken from AMD NPU driver 32.0.20102.3930 (xrt_coreutil.dll 32.00.20102.3931).
; Code that calls a new XRT function fails to link until it is added here.
; tools/check-xrt-driver.ps1 checks an installed driver against this list.
